<title>USA: Vectra Banking calls cumulative preferreds.</title>
<headline>Vectra Banking calls cumulative preferreds.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vectra Banking Corp said Friday that it will redeem all outstanding shares of its $0.95 Series A cumulative preferred stock on May 23, 1997, in accordance with its 1994 Statement which established the preferred stock.</p>
<p>The redemption price will be $10.30 per share, plus $0.14736 in accrued and unpaid dividends through the date of redemption.</p>
<p>Dividends on the preferred stock will no longer accrue after May 23, 1997.</p>
</text>
